# The CommonMark/GFM round-trip fixtures are compared byte-for-byte against the
# markdown the engine emits, and that output is always LF. With
# `core.autocrlf=true` (the default on many Windows setups) a checkout rewrites
# these files to CRLF and three of the fifteen round-trip cases fail locally
# while passing on CI — so pin the line ending instead of the test.
packages/muya/test/spec/fixtures/** text eol=lf
